      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BUILT FOR SPEED (2) has his first outing without a trial but profiles nicely for this. Likely to go close here first time out. SECATEUR (3) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last seven runs. Last time finished 2nd over 520m at this track beaten a neck (30.39) behind Solange in a Maiden on November 7. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Ready to find winning form. SLIM SIA (6) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Paw Nessa (30.71) in a Maiden. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to be in the finish again. HOT SHOT OHTANI (1) showed some ability on debut here and is given another chance. Can feature with the right run.",
